<!-- Restore My VPN: remembers the VPN that is on and sets it again after ours was used (RestoreShortcut.swift). Its
     input is a JSON dictionary with one key, read with Get Dictionary Value and tested with "has any value" only (a
     "contains" condition loses its text on import). Without input it does nothing.
       {"store":1}  Get Current VPN; if there is one: Set Stored Content, Remembered VPN. Finish Restore My VPN
       {"back":1}   Get Stored Content; if there is one: Restoring VPN, Set VPN (Connect). Finish Restore My VPN, which
                    doesn't come when Set VPN ends with an error, so Restoring VPN is before it
       {"check":1}  Finish Restore My VPN: touches no VPN
     Nothing is the last action: output there makes iOS ask over the app before the callback. -->
